## III. Ab Initio Exciton Model of B850

The Hamiltonian on the N=18 cyclic B850 ring is

$$
\hat H = E\hat{\mathbb 1} + \sum_A (Z_A \hat Z_A + X_A \hat X_A)
       + \sum_{A>B}(XX_{AB}\hat X_A\hat X_B + XZ_{AB}\hat X_A\hat Z_B
                  + ZX_{AB}\hat Z_A\hat X_B + ZZ_{AB}\hat Z_A\hat Z_B)
$$

(Eq. 8)...

