## Rerunning Nougat (if a future replicator wants the full extraction)

```bash
pip install nougat-ocr
nougat work/paper.pdf --out extraction/nougat_full/ --model 0.1.0-base
mv extraction/nougat_full/paper.mmd extraction/nougat.mmd
```

Estimated time: ~2 minutes on CPU, ~30 s on UICGPU A100.
Model size: ~1.4 GB on first-run download.

